# # /managraph/
#
# Permanent identifiers for ManaGraph, a linked data knowledge graph of
# Magic: The Gathering cards: https://github.com/GuySchnidrig/ManaGraph
#
# - https://w3id.org/managraph/ontology is the ManaGraph ontology. RDF clients
#   asking for Turtle get the Turtle file, everyone else the documentation.
# - Every other IRI (cards, printings, sets, types, ...) is described by the
#   ManaGraph SPARQL endpoint: RDF clients asking for Turtle or N-Triples get
#   the result of DESCRIBE <iri> from it. Everyone else is sent to the project
#   site, which shows the IRI and links to the same query.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Dr. Guy Schnidrig
# ORCID: https://orcid.org/0009-0003-8320-8498
# GitHub username: GuySchnidrig

RewriteEngine on

# Ontology as Turtle
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^ontology/?$ https://guyschnidrig.github.io/ManaGraph/ontology/managraph.ttl [R=303,L]

# Ontology documentation, the default for browsers and other clients
RewriteRule ^ontology/?$ https://guyschnidrig.github.io/ManaGraph/ontology/ [R=303,L]

# Any other IRI as RDF: DESCRIBE it on the SPARQL endpoint
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} (text/turtle|application/n-triples)
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://homelab.taila88e34.ts.net/?query=DESCRIBE\%20\%3Chttps://w3id.org/managraph/$1\%3E [R=303,NE,L]

# Everything else: the project site
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://guyschnidrig.github.io/ManaGraph/$1 [R=302,L]
